    narr:childCount "39"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "d60479f4df57bd74c60ef357e16a3ce7cbb09a43" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative traces how a fundraising posture was built in a single conversation: from [a bridge raise with named targets](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_102) through [the YC application push](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_143) to [the marketplace framing of the raise itself](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_191). The core move is [a staged, time-bound process](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_193) that opens with [an advice-seeking first round](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_195) scripted as [a traction-first ask for referrals](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_197), then flips to [a declarative raise with a hard end date](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_199) where [the funder must justify their dollars](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_205). Sequencing advice runs alongside: [holding the biggest lever until there's ammunition](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_183), backed by [the howitzer metaphor](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_185), plus [specific introductions offered](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_177) and [a warm-contact shortlist](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_171). It closes on [a committed near-term action](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_222).""" ;
